{"body_markdown":"## 原研究目标与已完成范围\n以固定有限整数binary64输入比较顺序和补偿方法误差，保存反例与可核验过程。原定三轮已完成，现已补齐L1–L4。\n\n## 续接边界\n下一阶段先选择非整数、极端指数、跨平台或性能中的一个独立问题，制定精确基准后另建Run；本记录不表示新试验已经开始。","change_reason":"resume首次仅返回经验，补齐显式目标和检查点以保留继续研究所需内容","content_hash":"0c276fc397aae959238da978787571f01f2434d3ee4721bd2bd0d1eeebdf765e","created_at":"2026-09-08T22:11:23.019734Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-development-agent-default-skill-acceptance","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"owner_only","keywords":["目标","浮点求和"],"kind":"goal","level":null,"owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"change_impact":"把原PLAN与已保存地图中的目标显式登记供续接；不改变历史计算范围或认可状态。","constraints":["不覆盖旧Run和固定输入。","不将构造样本推广为普适正确性。","研究结论未人工复核。"],"missing_refs":[],"objective":"在明确输入域与精确参考下理解求和误差，保留可核验反例和过程。","previous_goal_ref":null,"success_criteria":["已完成三轮的输入、方法、结果、限制与详细说明可按固定引用读取。","新增输入域必须另建Run并保留精确基准与失败。"]},"previous_revision":null,"provenance_gap":null,"record_hash":"942b428430701fe15176250bd73d682b6c10379ba2ae1ef07afc5d8e0410c4f7","record_id":"MEM-3090dc56-e320-5db7-8489-e0bff4d9a153","record_reason":"resume首次仅返回经验，补齐显式目标和检查点以保留继续研究所需内容","revision":1,"schema_version":2,"sensitivity":"internal","sources":[{"locator":"当前正文与来源","relation":"references","revision":2,"sha256":"642d825a9f97d1f4e94be8b1e96a5f643d489d380164ea5978ac72a3a4bd761a","target_id":"MEM-58fd845a-05a5-516c-8bbe-c88d887cbb91","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"当前正文与来源","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"4641fa7123eff703b6016273f3940234d23f373e64a82bd9020eaae19db1d26f","target_id":"MEM-96f79923-f023-509e-a002-40f2d5a4fca1","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"当前正文与来源","relation":"references","revision":2,"sha256":"5373ff5a9bd214a1a20af2563c3a6b167de5dfa5a5400d100c2ccda45e79d695","target_id":"MEM-a8226b54-a4cd-545a-8f22-422c2f513bfc","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"当前正文与来源","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"460e6d19c4f8ee3be998c33b7a9e8b0d42fc6b21babb4282648a4d9c6c90ae59","target_id":"MEM-c4a61c00-1bf1-59b3-a65e-0fa4847db2e1","target_kind":"reco